'''Blood Stance''' and '''Sand Stance''' are [[stance]] statuses provided by {{il|Blood and Sand}} and {{il|Flesh and Stone}}. The buff/debuff from the stance depends on which aforementioned skill is used. These skills can be activated again to switch between Blood Stance and Sand Stance. Certain attack skills behave differently based on which stance you are using.

==Mechanics==
Stance setting is shared between all skills that grant Blood or Sand Stance. Toggling one will toggle the other.

Skills and passives which interact with Blood and Sand Stance will use Blood Stance by default if you are not actively in either stance (e.g. if you do not have either of the toggle gems equipped).

==Related skill gems==
The following [[skill gem]]s are related to Blood and Sand Stance:

{{Drop enabled gem table
|where = items.class_id="Active Skill Gem"
  AND (skill.description LIKE "%Blood Stance%"
    OR skill.description LIKE "%Sand Stance%")
}}

==Related unique items==
The following [[unique item]]s are related to Blood Stance and Sand Stance:
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=item_stats.id LIKE "%Blood_Stance%"
    OR item_stats.id LIKE "%Sand_Stance%"
|large=1
|base_item=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

==Miscellaneous==
* The [[Crucible Passive Skill Tree]] can grant [[Stance Swap]] as a triggered skill, which requires the use of {{il|Perforate}} or {{il|Lacerate}}.

==Related passive skills==

===Passive skills===
The following [[passive skill]]s are related to Blood and Sand Stance:
{{Query base passive skills
|where=passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Sand%stance%"
    OR passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Blood%Stance%"
    OR passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Stance_Skill%"
}}

===Masteries===
The following [[Passive Mastery|Masteries]] are related to Blood and Sand Stance:
{{Query masteries|where=mastery_effects.stat_text_raw LIKE "% Stance%"}}

